stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Configured
  Configured --> Queued: create generation job
  Queued --> Generating
  Generating --> Validating
  Validating --> Ready: public questions valid and private keys stored
  Validating --> Failed
  Queued --> Cancelled: cancel
  Generating --> Cancelled: cancel
  Ready --> Attempt: begin with server time
  Attempt --> Attempt: answer, navigate and heartbeat
  Attempt --> Review
  Review --> Attempt: edit answer
  Review --> Submitted: idempotent final submit
  Attempt --> Abandoned: quit, sign out or TTL
  Submitted --> Grading
  Grading --> Result
  Grading --> Failed: bounded retry state
  Cancelled --> Cleaned
  Abandoned --> Cleaned
  Failed --> Cleaned: ephemeral data expiry
  Result --> [*]
  Cleaned --> [*]
